{"about_the_game":"Lani's Call: A Tiny Whale Singer Story is a 10 min game experience where you can play with Lani, a playful humpback whale, who dives into action when an earthshaking event threatens her underwater home.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494560/extras/Steam_titles_featuresLani.png?t=1742462073\" /><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glide Lani through vibrant coral reefs, dense seaweed jungles, and dark ocean depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494560/extras/seaweed.gif?t=1742462073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Call out with Lani's voice to commune with other humpbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494560/extras/call-out.gif?t=1742462073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Take advantage of Lani's massive size to rescue smaller creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494560/extras/rescue.gif?t=1742462073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Discover what lies at the end of the glimmering trail...<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494560/extras/trail.gif?t=1742462073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>This cosy, emotional adventure offers a heartfelt introduction to the richly woven WHALE SINGER universe.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3494560?t=1742462073","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494560/42f5e140fe158394ac8b41accf053ee98ec12d25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742462073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494560/a6af11594d0e270a149a26e6cdae00058855e474/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1